# Local working notes, not part of the submission.
STATUS.md

# Cached raw CoinW responses. The manifest IS committed, so the provenance and
# SHA-256 of every byte the results were computed from is in version control,
# while ~90 MB of klines is not. `python run_backtest.py --all` refetches them.
data/*.json
!data/manifest.json

# These two are small and are the evidence behind claims made in prose -- the
# exchange constraints the engine enforces, and the CWC currency status asserted
# in README.md. Committed so a reviewer can check them without a network call.
!data/returnSymbol.json
!data/returnCurrencies.json
